      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Address: /vrchat/world\nEvent: On World Change\nContents: Old world ID, New World ID\nReason:  I would like to request that a world change event be fired off when a user changes a world.  Reason for this is that OSC app developers can get a reliable way of figuring out what world a user has gone to.  This has the implications that it would be harder for a malicious world to fake another world for the purpose of data manipulation.\nEDIT:\nRevising what would be in the contents, if possible.\nContents: Old World ID, New World ID, New World Name (String)",
